# (CRUSTERMAN) EDIT held, a white key: the chord to that degree of the scale, now. Leeward is D Aeolian: the fifth
# white key (w4) is the fifth degree, A (9); the first (w0) home, D (2). EDIT let go after it: no "next chord", and
# held on with a key pressed, no new progression
wait 1000
expect chordroot 2
press EDIT
wait 100
key w4 down
wait 100
key w4 up
wait 100
release EDIT
wait 300
expect chordroot 9
expect view 0
wait 4000
expect chordroot 9
press EDIT
wait 100
tapkey w3
wait 2000
release EDIT
wait 300
expect chordroot 7
press EDIT
wait 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
release EDIT
wait 300
expect chordroot 2
# without EDIT the white keys are the Lead's, as ever: the chord stays
tapkey w4
wait 500
expect chordroot 2
